<!--
  Default simulated location for running in the Simulator: the East Passage off
  Newport, Rhode Island. A short track rather than a single point, so the boat
  has a speed and a course over ground and the course-up chart behaves the way
  it does on the water. Xcode interpolates between the waypoint times.
-->
